  {"code":"12120","name":"Outmaneuver the Enemy","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":10,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"A Storm on Cobas Haven","stage":"1A","keywords":{"sailing":true},"timings":["setup","forced","constant"],"text":"Setup: Prepare the Corsair deck. Players prepare their fleet. Set each copy of Dol Amroth Warship aside, out of play. Search the encounter deck for Raider Flagship and 1 copy of Scouting Ship, and add them to the staging area. Search the encounter deck for a Dol Amroth objective of your choice and add it to the staging area. Then, shuffle the encounter deck and resolve the Guarded keyword on that objective.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Sailing.\nForced: When a Ship enemy engages you, if you are off-course (Cloud, Rain, or Storm), deal 2 damage to a Ship objective you control. If you are on-course (Sun), deal 2 damage to that Ship enemy instead.\nIf your current heading is at the worst setting (Storm), Raider Flagship gets -50 engagement cost.","questPoints":10,"stage":"1B"},"printings":[{"pack":"SoCH","number":120,"hobSlug":"Outmaneuver-the-Enemy-ASoCH","octgnGuid":"d0bf9c82-d626-4602-a383-4a5660a08c5f","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/d0bf9c82-d626-4602-a383-4a5660a08c5f.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/A-Storm-on-Cobas-Haven/Outmaneuver-the-Enemy-1A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/A-Storm-on-Cobas-Haven/Outmaneuver-the-Enemy-1B.jpg"]}]},
  {"code":"12121","name":"Battle in the Bay","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":16,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"A Storm on Cobas Haven","stage":"2A","keywords":{"sailing":true},"timings":["whenRevealed","constant","constant"],"text":"When Revealed: Search the encounter deck and discard pile for a Ship enemy and add it to the staging area (2 Ship enemies instead if there are 3 or more players in the game). Shuffle the encounter deck. For each unguarded objective in the staging area, attach a non-unique Ship enemy in the staging area to that objective, guarding it.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Sailing.\nIf your current heading is at the worst setting (Storm), Raider Flagship gets -50 engagement cost.\nYou cannot advance while at least 1 objective is guarded by an encounter.","questPoints":16,"stage":"2B"},"printings":[{"pack":"SoCH","number":121,"hobSlug":"Battle-in-the-Bay-ASoCH","octgnGuid":"e3adad02-fa99-4905-bb20-d414ba76f75f","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/e3adad02-fa99-4905-bb20-d414ba76f75f.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/A-Storm-on-Cobas-Haven/Battle-in-the-Bay-2A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/A-Storm-on-Cobas-Haven/Battle-in-the-Bay-2B.jpg"]}]},
  {"code":"12122","name":"Break Through the Fleet!","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":5,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"A Storm on Cobas Haven","stage":"3A","keywords":{"sailing":true},"timings":["whenRevealed","constant","constant","constant"],"text":"When Revealed: The players make engagement checks against each enemy in the staging area. Raider Flagship gets -50 engagement cost during these engagement checks.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Sailing.\nRaider Flagship gets -50 engagement cost.\nBreak Through the Fleet! has +5 quest points for each Ship enemy in play.\nIf this stage is defeated, or if Raider Flagship is in the victory display, the players have broken through the Corsair fleet and win the game!","questPoints":5,"stage":"3B"},"printings":[{"pack":"SoCH","number":122,"hobSlug":"Break-Through-the-Fleet-ASoCH","octgnGuid":"233a2687-04a8-4c18-90cc-e90b9574b282","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/233a2687-04a8-4c18-90cc-e90b9574b282.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/A-Storm-on-Cobas-Haven/Break-Through-the-Fleet-3A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/A-Storm-on-Cobas-Haven/Break-Through-the-Fleet-3B.jpg"]}]},
